00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:12.900
<i>What should we do?</i>
<i>We're not used to facing adversity</i>

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:18.020
<i>So our resolve's definitely not all there</i>

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:20.440
<i>Back then, we were just</i>

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:22.770
<i>Envious of others and</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:27.480
<i>Angry at something we couldn't see</i>

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:30.020
<i>We just kept glaring at the next step</i>

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:32.400
<i>That we could've easily taken</i>

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:37.350
<i>And it was eating away at us silently</i>

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:41.150
<i>We were so scared that we went numb</i>

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:43.560
<i>And our legs buckled from under us</i>

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:48.440
<i>We still can't forget the tears</i>
<i>that fell back then even now</i>

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:53.270
<i>Even though we're so frail we might break,</i>
<i>we still continued to seek love</i>

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:58.400
<i>We don't want to forget the reason</i>
<i>we're standing on this stage</i>

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:03.190
<i>Because you're the one who made me stronger</i>

00:02:03.190 --> 00:02:07.650
<i>I give you this lovely ballad</i>
<i>within this beautiful attack</i>

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:20.450
Episode 12: 'Runway'

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:20.450
Episode 12: 'Runway'

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:22.200
Fukuho Tech

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:22.200
Seiin

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:41.100
W-We won! We actually won!

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:42.310
Yeah...

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:44.850
Thank you!

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.020
Haijima?

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:52.770
Haijima?

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:53.610
Hey! Haijima!

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:55.270
Haijima!

00:02:56.400 --> 00:03:04.480
We were finally able to beat your team,
but all of you put up quite the fight.

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:06.350
Well done out there.

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:08.150
Thank you!

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:18.440
Mimura.

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:19.560
Yes, sir?

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:24.060
You're just going to continue to get stronger.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:29.980
Great job!

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:34.600
Thank you for your support!

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:36.100
Great job! What a great match!

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:38.690
--Thanks, Subaru!
--Subaru!

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:41.900
After seven years of saying I'd take him...

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:46.650
I'm sorry I can't take you to the nationals!

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:48.520
Third years, up front!

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:50.440
S-Sure...

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:53.270
Kohei, here.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.250
{=1}Fukuho Tech

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.290
What...?

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:55.290
{=1}Fukuho Tech

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:55.380
{=1}Fukuho Tech

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:56.350
Yeah.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:55.500
{=1}Fukuho Tech

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:56.250
{=1}Fukuho Tech

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:56.380
Fukuho Tech

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:56.500
Fukuho Tech

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:02.480
Thank you for the last three years!

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:06.020
Next year, these guys are gonna
come back as challengers.

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:08.230
We hope you'll be back to support them!

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:10.400
Thank you!

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.600
Subaru

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.600
Mimura

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.600
Shinichiro

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.600
Oda

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:17.150
Is Haijima all right?

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.650
Yeah, I think so.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:21.350
Hopefully it won't affect him during nationals.

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:23.480
I mean, he's gonna be essential to the game.

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:25.730
Hey, Mimura. Did you hurt your knee--

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:27.310
Man!

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:31.100
I never thought it'd be you
to shut me down in the end!

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:33.560
To be honest, I underestimated you.

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:35.690
Let's play again in college.

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:39.230
Though it might take me a while to come back.

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:41.850
This time, you get to wait for me.

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:43.190
Mimura...

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.900
Fukuho Tech

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.020
Ow!

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:05.190
It's been hurting ever since then.

00:05:05.190 --> 00:05:06.600
Damn it!

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:14.560
What? Did you finally get over being a cry baby?

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:17.520
How am I supposed to cry... when you can't?

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:20.400
I honestly feel pretty good.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:22.150
If I had to say something shitty like

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:26.730
I'm glad I was okay because
you got hurt instead,

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:28.520
I'm glad we lost.

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:30.770
Subaru...

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:34.480
But that doesn't mean we
let down our guard and lost.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:37.150
They seriously crushed us.

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:42.940
Like that serve... If I'd just
confidently said it was out...

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:46.650
I can think of so many mistakes right now.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:49.020
Everyone messes up during matches!

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:51.900
You all fought your best out there!
It's not just your fault--

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:53.650
I know that!

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:56.400
But any of those things could've
turned the game around.

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:59.520
We panicked and lost all the sets with deuces.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:04.980
I couldn't get that one point we needed.

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:09.230
I didn't want to lose.

00:06:09.230 --> 00:06:12.060
I wanted to win...

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:14.020
No matter what.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:15.520
Subaru!

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:20.600
Subaru! Subaru!

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:22.690
Ochi...

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:26.770
Hey, your cast is pushing
into my back. It hurts.

00:06:26.770 --> 00:06:32.060
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry...
I couldn't take you there.

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:35.440
Don't apologize! Don't you dare apologize!

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:37.600
You were planning to cry
alone later, weren't you?

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:40.150
Well, you're not crying alone!

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:44.400
Y-You dumbass. Like I'd ever cry.

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:53.150
Coach...

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:54.520
Sir.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:00.980
Coach, I'm really sorry.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:04.690
You've waited eight years,
ever since I was in grade school.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:08.730
You idiot. I waited because I wanted to.

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:10.690
You did great out there!

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:13.020
I know you all did everything you could.

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:17.190
The reason we didn't win is
I just didn't do enough for all of you.

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:19.060
Subaru...

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:20.060
We're sorry...

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:22.400
--We're sorry, Subaru.
--Subaru...

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:30.100
I'm sorry, guys...

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:33.020
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry!

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:46.560
I'll come back...
Even if that dream is gone now.

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:49.980
If I'm feeling this much frustration...

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:51.900
I'm going to come back.

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:56.060
I'm going to have surgery, do PT...

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:59.480
And I'm going to play volleyball again.

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:07.150
Where... I'm back home?

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:12.190
Wait, I have my contacts on.

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:15.600
Wait, there's a game today!

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:22.480
Did it get canceled because of the snow?

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:24.900
Hey, you're awake!

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.600
Senpai! Look, it's Haijima!

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:30.400
So this is the place.

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:33.350
We're coming over!

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:33.350
Hope you don't mind.

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:38.600
Uh... You came all the way here?

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:40.850
Hey! Watch how you say that!

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:46.020
They were gonna throw us a party
at Kuroba's place, so they gave us all a ride.

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:46.980
Shin.

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:48.020
Yeah.

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:54.520
Ahem.

