00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:00.730
Ta-dah.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:05.770
We won. Everyone on the boys volleyball team

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:09.020
at Nanafu Seiin High received medals.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:12.560
Congrats.

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:17.770
Th-Thank y--

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:19.730
Thank you, Haijima!

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:27.310
You helped us win.

00:09:33.850 --> 00:09:37.150
I still believe we can win.

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:41.060
You think I'm dreaming, Haijima?

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:43.310
It's not a dream.

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.480
The eight of us on Seiin's team

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:48.980
stepping onto the orange court
at the Tokyo Metropolitan Gymnasium.

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:52.650
I had clearly envisioned it from the start!

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:58.990
The height of the net for boys' volleyball
is 2.43 meters.

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:02.330
December

00:09:59.230 --> 00:10:02.690
Listen up, guys. We're going
over this one more time.

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:07.400
You guys are gonna follow through
on what we decided at the serving contest.

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:12.810
You guys were fourth, so you're gonna
get 20% better on all your midterms.

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:15.850
Third place is gonna get 10% better.

00:10:15.850 --> 00:10:18.520
And second place, 5%.

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:22.440
If you can't pull this off,
another penalty awaits.

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:25.400
Why do I have to do this? I was in first.

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:28.480
They announced the first team
we're playing against!

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:29.650
We're playing against...

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:33.900
Huh?! W-W-Wait, I'm not emotionally prepared...

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.900
Shofu High School.
They're from Tokushima Prefecture.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:38.560
Shofu High School...

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:40.900
A-Are they a good team?

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:43.690
I'm pretty sure they're going to nationals
for the first time, just like us.

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:46.650
To be honest, we're pretty lucky.

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:51.520
All right! Then let's just take the first round!

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:53.400
With where we're positioned...

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:57.270
...we're going to hit the top-seeded
team in the third round.

00:10:57.270 --> 00:10:58.810
Seriously?!

00:10:58.810 --> 00:11:00.730
So the top-seeded team means...

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:03.350
That would make them the strongest team.

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:04.980
The Inter-High and the nationals.

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:08.020
They're a powerhouse team from Fukuoka that won

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:09.520
both of those tournaments this year...

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:11.060
Miboshi High.

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:13.060
S-So you're saying they're good?

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:14.480
Of course, they are.

