00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:24.100
Tokyo's one of the most competitive
districts, and they came out on top.

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:25.850
Well, that's not good.

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:27.440
So you're saying they're also good.

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:29.230
Yeah, they are.

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:32.310
Hey, why all the glum faces?

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:33.980
We're making our debut!

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:36.980
We're just gonna have to do
our best as the challengers!

00:11:36.980 --> 00:11:39.480
Let's just keep going higher,
once step at a time.

00:11:39.480 --> 00:11:41.400
What else are we gonna do?

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:44.560
It's not like we can back out of going.

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:49.150
Well, it's not like we've got anything to lose.

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:52.020
There's no reason to fear Miboshi or Keisei!

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:55.100
Yeah! Let's just take the top at nationals!

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:56.650
Yeah!

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:01.650
Haijima?

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:07.730
Hey, Haijima. What's up?

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:09.730
No... It's nothing.

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:13.350
What the? He's not excited at all.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:16.500
"Congratulations Boys Volleyball Team
for making it to the Nationals"

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:22.850
I think we got here a bit
too early. Right, Haijima?

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:25.560
Yeah...

00:12:26.770 --> 00:12:30.900
What's wrong with you? You've been acting weird.

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:34.100
You've been all down in the dumps
ever since we saw the match ups--

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:35.480
Hey, Aoki.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:39.810
You think we can win the Spring Tournament?

00:12:40.810 --> 00:12:45.020
It probably isn't realistic.

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:46.440
Get over here!

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:48.400
We don't really have any reserves.

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:52.650
I've never heard of a weak little team
suddenly winning the nationals before.

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:55.270
It's never that easy in real life.

00:12:55.270 --> 00:12:56.690
Yeah...

00:12:56.690 --> 00:13:00.520
It'd be more realistic to shoot for the
top four and get to the center court.

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:05.520
Honestly, that's sorta laughable, too.

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:12.060
In that case, my other goal
might be even more laughable.

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:13.940
And what's that?

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:15.850
That match...

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:19.980
...gave me another dream.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.060
Haijima and Mimura did.

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:25.730
So, hey. I'm gonna play
volleyball in college, too.

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:29.730
I don't have to give up what I want to do yet.

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:33.230
That match made me realize that.

00:13:33.230 --> 00:13:35.650
Wait, why are you laughing?

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:39.900
You never mentioned once that
you were gonna give up volleyball,

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:42.980
and I've never thought you
could leave volleyball behind.

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:46.980
W-Well, yeah. Volleyball's all I've got!

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:50.980
But, Aoki, you're different.

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:54.350
You have plenty of things you
could do other than volleyball.

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:58.310
You've got no reason to cling onto volleyball.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:04.770
So... I'm gonna sound a bit selfish here.

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:07.480
Shin...

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:10.900
Will you play volleyball a bit longer with me?

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:19.310
Hey, Haijima. You don't think we can win either?

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:22.690
I'm planning on winning.
I never thought we couldn't.

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:23.650
Huh?!

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:27.480
But you've been really down
ever since we saw the team match ups.

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:30.270
Well, there's no point in getting
that emotional over it.

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:34.060
Going up against a powerhouse school
early on will just make us stronger

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:35.730
and make things easier later.

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:39.480
You're so down to earth about this.

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:44.100
Then why were you so down yesterday?

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:46.850
I felt... conflicted.

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:49.230
It's not enough.

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:51.310
What's not enough?

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:53.400
I want to get Oda and the rest of the team

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:56.600
even better medals than the ones we just got.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:59.020
But that's still not enough.

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:01.810
I want something even... bigger.

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:08.190
Wow, how stupid are you?
That's not enough? That goal's plenty big!

00:15:08.190 --> 00:15:10.230
I wasted my time worrying about you!

00:15:10.230 --> 00:15:13.190
Of course you wouldn't be satisfied
with just being the prefectural reps!

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:16.060
You volleyball-obsessed weirdo.

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:19.140
End of December, Fukuho Technical High School

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:21.270
Certain Victory Hokushin'etsu Newcomer Battle
Fukuho Technical High School Volleyball Team Alumni

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.020
Playing against college students?

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:32.730
Coach Hata invited us
to participate in this joint practice.

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:34.940
We'll never get a chance like this again.

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:38.190
All right! We're gonna learn
everything we can here and

00:15:38.190 --> 00:15:39.900
take that to the Spring Tournament.

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:41.310
Got it?

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:42.980
Yeah!

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:52.350
Oh, I forgot a towel.

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:53.690
Wanna use mine?

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:54.850
Thanks.

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:10.940
Oh, these? They're making me use them,
even though I can walk just fine.

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:12.350
Oh, I see...

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:13.980
How are things shaping up?

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:15.730
You guys are heading out
after New Year's, right?

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:19.310
Huh? Uh... yes.

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:22.850
What's got you so quiet all of a sudden?

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:24.850
Not gonna glare at me anymore?

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:26.560
I have no reason to.

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:29.480
I mean, if you're saying that you
don't see me as a rival anymore,

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:31.980
that's pretty depressing, too.

00:16:34.150 --> 00:16:36.980
Wait, seriously?

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:39.350
You sure know how to make a guy sad.

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:41.310
I was watching you guys practice,

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:45.650
but you definitely aren't focused
like you were at the prelims.

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:49.730
You just looked like another
somewhat decent player.

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:54.560
Mimura... Was winning at the Spring
Tournament enough motivation for you?

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:58.770
Wha? You're really asking me that?

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:00.400
If you're asking me that

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:03.690
knowing how much I wanted
that to happen the last three years

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:05.770
you've really got some nerve.

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:06.980
I'm sorry.

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:10.560
Man, you're really weird sometimes.

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:13.980
Go to nationals and get
knocked down a few notches.

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:16.440
There's always someone better than you.

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:17.900
Right...

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:21.350
Um...

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:25.400
Is it rough... when you can't play volleyball?

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:28.560
Yeah, it sure is.

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:31.650
When you're not practicing,
you end up with so much extra energy

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:33.400
and you can't sleep at night.

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:36.100
Then you start thinking about things
you shouldn't be thinking about

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:39.560
and then keep falling deeper
and deeper into negativity.

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:43.400
Someone told me before...

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:47.060
But if you ever feel betrayed by volleyball,

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:50.400
I think it might hit you pretty hard.

00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:54.520
Kuroba also told me that I'm rushing too much.

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:58.940
Every player that's ever
gotten hurt has regrets.

00:17:58.940 --> 00:18:02.480
But you also realize some things
you've never realized before.

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:08.060
The scenery that just raced by
before finally stops.

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:12.600
You'll realize how important the goal
you were working toward is.

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:17.810
As embarrassing as this sounds,
you'll realize how much you loved it,

00:18:17.810 --> 00:18:20.230
and how much you want to go back.

00:18:20.230 --> 00:18:24.810
So yeah, you'll be fine.
There's no reason for you to be scared.

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:28.020
I wish we could've played on the same team.

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:30.060
But there's still a chance.

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:33.940
U21 and U19. You know what I'm talking about?

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:36.810
I'm gonna have surgery
at the beginning of the year.

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:40.310
I'll be going to college in Tokyo.
From there, I'm gonna continue my PT,

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:42.440
and come back within a year.

00:18:42.440 --> 00:18:45.440
Then I'm gonna work my way up to U21.

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:49.730
Though you and Kuroba will probably
be candidates for U19 first...

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:54.310
It's rare, but there are players
that get picked for both sometimes.

00:18:54.310 --> 00:18:56.310
If you get picked, you'll be playing overseas.

00:18:56.310 --> 00:18:59.650
We'll be playing against players
our age from around the world.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:01.150
The world...

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:04.650
But for that to happen, you'll have
to at least stand on the center--

00:19:04.650 --> 00:19:07.270
I... I'm gonna go talk to Kuroba!

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:08.650
Thanks!

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:10.810
Uh, sure.

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:12.650
I guess that towel's yours now.

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:20.650
Kuroba!

00:19:20.650 --> 00:19:22.400
Th-The hell?

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:25.190
I was just gonna look for you--

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:25.190
We're gonna get picked for U19

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:27.230
and U21!

00:19:27.230 --> 00:19:30.020
Then we'll be able to play on
the same team as Subaru Mimura!

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:32.480
Wh-What the heck are you talking about? U19?

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:34.230
The national youth team!

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:36.020
The team of young players
that'll represent Japan!

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:38.060
If we get picked, we'll be playing overseas!

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:39.020
Overseas?!

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:40.650
Yeah, the world!

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:43.310
So we've got to win at
the Spring Tournament first!

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:45.020
We're gonna dominate that center court!

00:19:45.020 --> 00:19:46.850
C-Calm down!

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:49.310
You're talking about the world suddenly?

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:53.190
I mean... You were determined
to go to Hokushin'etsu

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:55.810
even when we played in middle school.

00:19:55.810 --> 00:20:01.520
Do you always have to skip
like one or two steps ahead?

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:05.690
You might get picked... but I'd never
get picked for anything like that.

00:20:05.690 --> 00:20:08.440
I'm going to make sure they pick you.

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:12.150
I'm taking you with me...
because you're my limbs.

00:20:12.150 --> 00:20:16.190
Wait a minute... There was
an insult in there somewhere.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:21.400
You've got wings that'll take you super high...
And wings that are huge.

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:22.980
They're your limbs.

00:20:26.940 --> 00:20:28.900
I told you before.

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:35.310
I'm going to take everything
you want to do and be your ace.

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:39.650
Will you play volleyball a bit longer with me?

00:20:41.230 --> 00:20:43.520
I'm gonna get greedy.

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:48.270
I'm not going to be satisfied
with the small things.

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:51.440
Kuroba, let's play together.

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:54.850
Let's play volleyball together forever.

00:20:55.940 --> 00:21:01.560
<i>I don't want a wish to end as just a wish</i>

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:08.770
<i>But I know I'm going to live with that feeling</i>

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:17.600
<i>And as I toss and turn</i>

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:21.690
<i>The azure world smiles upon me</i>

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:34.020
<i>The knife made up of words from my friend</i>

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:40.940
<i>Still lingers inside my head today</i>

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:47.100
<i>You glared up at the clouds high in the sky</i>

00:21:48.270 --> 00:21:53.560
<i>And near your house, the horizon undulated</i>

00:21:55.440 --> 00:22:01.060
<i>I don't want a wish to end as just a wish</i>

00:22:02.690 --> 00:22:08.190
<i>But I know I'm going to live with that feeling</i>

00:22:09.940 --> 00:22:17.100
<i>And as I toss and turn</i>

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:25.270
<i>The azure world stabs me strongly in the back</i>

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:53.980
Let's go to the center court.

00:22:53.980 --> 00:22:56.060
Yeah, let's go.

00:22:58.400 --> 00:23:00.520
And to the world beyond that.
